    "chunk_text": "3AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'19PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 19.12.2019\n\nFOURTH PROCLAMATION\n\n1.Mr. Mohan R. A. Rathwaththa - Attoreney-at-Law (Chairman)2.Mr. Rajarathnam Gnanasekeram (Member)3.Mr. Dhanushka Weligama Attoreney-at-Law (Member)4.Mr. M. M. Vijitha Pieris Attoreney-at-Law (Member)5.Mr. R. M. Gunawardena (Member)6.Mr. M. S. M. Farook (Member)7.Mr. W. M. Senevirathna Weerasinghe Attoreney-at-Law (Member)8.Mr. D. Sujeewa Jayasinghe Attoreney-at-Law (Member)\n\nFIFTH PROCLAMATION\n\nBy this proclamation made under and by virtue of the powers vested in Article 154(C) and 154 (E) of theConstitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka and Section 6(2) of the Statute of the Uva Provincial Co-operative Employee's Commission No. 04 of 2010, it is decreed upon that the following persons are dismissed from theChairman/Membership of the Uva Provincial Co-operative Employee's Commission with effect from 19.12.2019.\n\n1.Mr. D. Sujeewa Sanath Waruna Jayasinghe - Attorney-at-Law (Chairman)2.Mr. K. M. Nandasena (Member)3.Mr. Singhamuththu Mahendran (Member)4.Mrs. P. Padmawathi (Member)5.Mr. K. H. M. J. C. Gunathileka (Member)\n\nRAJA COLLURE,Governor of Uva Province.\n\nOffice of the Governor of Uva Province,Kings Street,Badulla,19th December 2019.\n\n01 - 198\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
