    "chunk_text": "It is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Wanniarachchi Pathiran-nehelage Chaminda Sanjeewa Kumara described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 20th January 2020 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Section 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998. P.M.H. PRIYADARSHANI, Commissioner General of Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 05th December, 2019 SCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration\n\n(SECTION 55)\n\nReference the intestate property of late Mr. Wijayalath Pedige Lucky Demiyan who resided in the village of Ihala Madampella, in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Diulapitiya, in the District of Gampaha.\n\nIt is hereby notified that any person/s who have a claim to or interest in the intestate property of the late Mr. Wijayalath Pedige Lucky Demiyan described in the Schedule hereto should submit his/their claim to the undersigned in writing before 20th January 2020 stating his/their right or interest to such intestate property. In case of failure to do so, exparte action will be taken to register title under Sec-tion 55 (2) and (3) of the Registration of Title Act. No. 21 of 1998.\n\nP.M.H. PRIYADARSHANI, Commissioner General of Title Settlement Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Madura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 05th December, 2019 SCHEDULE Divisional Village Cadastral Parcel No. Extent of Land Certificate Office of Secretary\u2019s Division Map No. of Title No. Registration"
