    "chunk_text": "1AIV (w) jeks fldgi \u2014 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2019'12'20PART IV(A) \u2014 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 20.12.2019\n\nw;s \u00fafYI\n\nwxl 2154$52 - 2019 foie\u00efn\u00be ui 20 jeks isl=rdod - 2019'12'20No. 2154/52 - FRIDAY, DECEMBER 20, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARYThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n(Published by Authority)PART IV (A) \u2014 PROVINCIAL COUNCILS\n\nAppointments & C., by the Governors\n\nY%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha .ei\u00dc m;%h\n\nNORTH CENTRAL PROVINCE PROVINCIAL COUNCIL\n\nAppointments made by the Hon. Governor of North Central Provincial Council\n\nBY virtue of the power vested under Section 32(a) of the Provincial Council Act, No. 42 of 1987, Hon. Sarath Ekanayake,the Governor of the North Central Province, do hereby notify that the officers, names mentioned below have been appointnedfor the posts North Central Provincial Council Services.\n\n01.Mrs. Thejani Thilakerathne, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the DeputySecretary (Admin.) of the Chief Ministry of North Central Province with effect from 28.01.2019.\n\n02.Mr. W. A. R. Wimalasiri, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service (retired) as the Secretaryof the Proivincial Public Service Commission of North Central Province for 03 months with effect from11.03.2019 to 10.06.2019 on contract basis.\n\n03.Mr. Ananda Kularathne, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service (retired) as the Secretaryof the Chief Ministry of North Central Province for 02 months with effect from 01.07.2019 untill 31.08.2019on contract basis.\n\n04.Mr. P. K. Jayalath, Officer in Special Grade of Sri Lanka Administrative Service as the Secretary of theMinistry of Provincial Lands, Irrigation, Highways, Rural Development, House and Women Affairs of NorthCentral Provincial Council with effect from 17.05.2019 untill 31.08.2019 on contract basis."
