    "md5": "4a5858b886921b2a2c4797f6a9cd0de0",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2127,
    "chunk_text": "The Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2154/58 - 2019 \u0dd9\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd0\u023c\u0db6\u0259 \u0db8\u0dc3 21 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u0dd9\u0dc3\u0db1\u0288\u0dbb\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dcf - 2019.12.21\n\nNo. 2154/58 \u2013 SATURDAY, DECEMBER 21, 2019\n\nEXTRAORDINARY\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 07\n\nMinistry of Lands and Land Development Reference\n\nNumber : 4-3/2/2016/A/402. Divisional Secretary's Number:\n\nBD/HD/LND/03/01/P .O. Q.\n\nI, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 07 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lans which is required for the purpose of acquiring land for the official residence of a Project Officer of the Department of Export Agriculture.\n\nDescription of the Land to be Acquired:\n\nThe allotments of lands situated in the Grama Niladhari Divisions of Ranasinghagama (155-H) Village of Ranasinghagama in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Haldummulla, Badulla District in Uva Province depicted in Plan No. 729, and dated 27.08.2019 prepared by the Surveyor-General, containing in extent 0.2000 Hectare and described as follows :\n\n01. Lot No. 1 Name of the land: Lemaswaththa (Pettigala Part); Description: The wasteland; Claimant : Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.0330 Hectare.\n\nBoundaries of the Land : North: Kandura, Pettigala Estate claimed by Land Reform Commission and Lot No. 02; East: Pettigala Estate claimed by Land Reform Commission, Lot Nos. 2 and 4; South: Lots 2, 4 and kandura; West : Kandura.\n\n02. Lot No. 2 Name of the land: Lemaswaththa (Pettigala Division); Description: Garden, 20-30 years old mixed Cultivation & Permanent Building; Claimant: Land Reform Commission; Extent: 0.1288 Hectare.\n\nBoundaries of the Land : North: Lot No. 4 and Pettigala Estate claimed by Land Reform Commission; East: Pettigala Estate claimed by Land Reform Commission and Lot Nos. 3 and 4; South: Lots 3, 4 and 1; West: Lot No. 01\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\n1A\n\n(Published by Authority)"
  },
